"2-minute rounds, best of 3. Modes: Classic (open field) and Maze Battle. "
msgstr "2分钟的回合,最好3次. 模式:经典(开放场)和Maze Battle."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1512
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"3 shared lives, 50 neon blocks (5 rows), ball speeds up. Arrow keys or A/D "
"to move."
msgstr "3条共享生命,50条霓虹板(5行),球速度加快. 箭键或 A/D 移动."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1907
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "3-minute race in permanent darkness with fog bursts. "
msgstr "3分钟的比赛 在永久的黑暗中 雾暴。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2714
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
